abstract: >
  Reference implementation of the ConnectomeGuard validation framework. Processes raw
  ABIDE-II diffusion MRI data through skull stripping, tensor estimation, CSD FOD
  computation, EuDX deterministic tractography, atlas registration, and 100x100
  Schaefer connectome construction. Supports 5 acquisition sites across the
  ABIDE-II consortium.
